al and takes her home at once.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h3V1cRvarwnagcinxYm4PlCV0f7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Despite having a fever, Fushihara is working overtime at the office again today. Taking notice of this, Yuurei-chan yells \"You're gonna work yourself to death!\" and proceeds to try and persuade Fushihara to leave. When Fushihara tells her that her being there with her motivates her, Yuurei-chan proposes that she go home with her, so that she can finish her work at home. Easily swayed by the ever-so-cute little baby ghost, Fushihara promptly agrees to her proposal and takes her home at once.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h3V1cRvarwnagcinxYm4PlCV0f7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"60481","synopsis":"When Yuurei-chan appears in the office one night, Fushihara is oddly nowhere to be seen. Yuurei-chan is happy at first to see that Fushihara was able to leave early, but soon realizes that now she feels lonely without her. On top of that, a thunderstorm begins to roar outside. With tears in her eyes, Yuurei-chan tries to convince herself she's not afraid. That she's not lonely. Then moments later, she hears the sound of the office door opening...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tpoEdR33z9cMfHQ2JZDvtktSaRV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"When Yuurei-chan appears in the office one night, Fushihara is oddly nowhere to be seen. Yuurei-chan is happy at first to 