into her home. Later, when Fushihara is doing overtime at the office, Yuurei-chan and Myako begin fighting over who gets to help her with her work...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kEWfa7wYwb2ZyytQsKt6dCM4ouc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"61319","synopsis":"The 5th of May is known as Children's Day in Japan. On this day, many people display koinobori or koi fish streamers in celebration. Back at the office, Fushihara is more worked up than usual. Knowing what day it is and having the image of Yuurei-chan and Myako looking fondly out at the koi fish streamers outside the window in her head, she's determined to get all her work done early today. Meanwhile at the apartment, Yuurei-chan and Myako are plucking daisy petals, wishing for Fushihara's safe return home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6L1PAxzcLf6DUrv3ksLVCiVASFM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"The 5th of May is known as Children's Day in Japan. On this day, many people display koinobori or koi fish streamers in celebration. Back at the office, Fushihara is more worked up than usual. Knowing what day it is and having the image of Yuurei-chan and Myako looking fondly out at the koi fish streamers outside the window in her head, she's determined to get all her work done early today. Meanwhile at the apartment, Yuurei-chan and Myako are plucking daisy petals, wishing for Fushihara's safe return home.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6L1PAxzcLf6DUrv3ksLVCiVASFM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"61597","synopsis":"Myako loves to brush her hair. In fact, her brush happens to hold a lot of memories for her. One day, Fushihara and Yuurei-chan are curious to learn about the story behind this well-loved item, so Myako begins to recount the tale of how she came to own it. She tells the story about how she, a ghost cat who had never once found a place among humans nor cats, finally found a place to call home. And it begins not too long before Myako and Fushihara met...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vrRsFYoUyllKc9apQ37wujeCUqz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Myako loves to brush her hair. In fact, her brush happens to hold a lot of memories for her. One day, Fushihara and Yuurei-chan are curious to learn about the story behind this well-loved item, so Myako begins to recount the tale of how she came to own it. She tells the story about how she, a ghost cat who had never once found a place among humans nor cats, finally found a place to call home. And it begins not too long before Myako and Fushihara met...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vrRsFYoUyllKc9apQ37wujeCUqz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"61679","synopsis":"It's now summertime. Today, Yuurei-chan is eating the green peppers she hates, so that she can grow big and tall. Meanwhile, Fushihara is blissfully imagining the two with randoseru backpacks over their shoulders, a classic backpack worn by elementary schoolchildren in Japan. Her living together with Yuurei-chan and Myako had become commonplace at this point. However, Fushihara realizes she still has much to learn about the two little ghosts and decides to ask them for their birthdays. Since Yuurei-chan was born around this time of year, Fushihara decides to give her a certain gift...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c3mS3bAbsjbLHOrBgDEjVnIDBV4.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"It's now summertime. Today, Yuurei-chan is eating the green peppers she hates, so that she can grow big and tall. Meanwhile, Fushihara is blissfully imagining the two with randoseru backpacks over their shoulders, a classic backpack worn by elementary schoolchildren in Japan. Her living together with Yuurei-chan and Myako had become commonplace at this point. However, Fushihara realizes she still has much to learn about the two little ghosts and decides to ask them for their birthdays. Since Yuurei-chan was born around this time of year, Fushihara decides to give her a certain gift...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c3mS3bAbsjbLHOrBgDEjVnIDBV4.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"61806","synopsis":"One night, Fushihara discovers that her next-door neighbor Kurahashi-san has been living with a little ghost maid called Lily. Owing to the fact that they can both see ghosts, Fushihara and Kurahashi-san quickly become friends. While Kurahashi-san leads a slovenly lifestyle working from home as an illustrator, Lily spends most of her days scolding Kurahashi-san in utter disgust for her slobbish behavior. Despite this, the two seem to be getting along one way or another...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5hPAN3bccgRdh5X0BzQtfN3Omz.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"One night, Fushihara discovers that her next-door neighbor Kurahashi-san has been living with a little ghost maid called Lily. Owing to the fact that they can both see ghosts, Fushihara and Kurahashi-san quickly become friends. While Kurahashi-san leads a slovenly lifestyle working from home as an illustrator, Lily spends most of her days scolding Kurahashi-san in utter disgust for her slobbish behavior. Despite this, the two seem to be getting along one way or another...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5hPAN3bccgRdh5X0BzQtfN3Omz.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"62151","synopsis":"There's no more food left in fridge at home, so Yuurei-chan and Myako head to the nearby shopping district to buy groceries. Nervous and with a shopping list given to them by Fushihara in hand, the two embark on their first ever errand. However, their shopping trip comes to a halt when the fishmonger happens to be a scary-looking man and Myako can't seem to find the words to ask for the fish they need. Thankfully, an old friend comes to save the day...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ikXp8aYAgZdoY3gNPUH8LuO06Yy.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"There's no more food left in fridge at home, so Yuurei-chan and Myako head to the nearby shopping district to buy groceries. Nervous and with a shopping list given to them by Fushihara in hand, the two embark on their first ever errand. However, their shopping trip comes to a halt when the fishmonger happens to be a scary-looking man and Myako can't seem to find the words to ask for the fish they need. Thankfully, an old friend comes to save the day...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ikXp8aYAgZdoY3gNPUH8LuO06Yy.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16376","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"135384","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49160","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"127327","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"412391","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"62241","synopsis":"It's already winter. And with the winter, comes Christmas. When Fushihara explains the holiday to a bewildered Yuurei-chan and Myako, their reaction is a little lacking in excitement. Thinking it must just be because they've never experienced the holiday before, Fushihara tells the two of them that Santa will be coming to their place this year. The two happily write down what they want from Santa in a letter, but what they end up a